    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a mage, you gain the following class features.</p><h2>Hit Points</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d6 per mage level</p><p><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 6 + your Constitution modifier</p><p><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d6 (or 4) + your Constitution modifier per mage level after 1st</p><h2>Proficiencies</h2><p><strong>Armor:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Weapons:</strong> Simple weapons</p><p><strong>Tools:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Choose two from Arcana, History, Insight, Investigation, Medicine, and Religion</p><h2>Equipment</h2><p>You start with the following equipment, in addition to the equipment granted by your background:</p><ul><li><p>(a) a quarterstaff or (b) a dagger</p></li><li><p>(a) a component pouch or (b) an arcane focus</p></li><li><p>(a) a scholar's pack or (b) an explorer's pack</p></li><li><p>A spellbook</p></li></ul><h2>Class Table</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Sorcery Points</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1st</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>2</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>X</strong></p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.class-features.Item.ZoJk9d1grvjxx16O]{Spellcasting}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.class-features.Item.wU2lLwy8CxxfJ71J]{Magic Sense}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2nd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.class-features.Item.bliEflLlXJuPuyYo]{Font of Magic}, Magical Study</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td><p>Metamagics, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.class-features.Item.ZFwVQmxRIaR8S7I3]{Cantrip Formula}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td><p>Magical Study feature</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">8th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">8</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">10th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">10</p></td><td><p>Magical Study feature, Bonus Metamagic</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">11th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">11</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">12th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">12</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">13th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">13</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">14th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">14</p></td><td><p>Magical Study feature</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">15th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">15</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">16th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">16</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">17th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">17</p></td><td><p>Bonus Metamagic</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">18th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">18</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.class-features.Item.ZVI7YXLcAfhAKqzc]{Spell Mastery}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">19th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">19</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">20th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"76\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"63\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">20</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-bestiary.class-features.Item.c9j9TpFGmtTfeXsS]{Signature Spells}</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
